    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Qualifying a claim",
     "texto": [
      "**Det kan tyde på at ...** means «that may indicate that...». The expression presents a possible interpretation, not a certainty.",
      "**Å skyldes** signals a cause; **å lindre** means to ease and **å forverre** means to worsen."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
